  <regions type="content">
    <region left="20" top="64" width="1560" height="32" color="#000000" fontSize="15" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 15px;">STGAP3SXS Gate Driver Calculation  -  GOUT, R.g_on and (D.off + R.g_off), 0 V off</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="110" width="1560" height="51" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">Network as on the EVLSTGAP3SXS-H board: GOUT - R.g_on - gate, and D.off in series with R.g_off across R.g_on, cathode at GOUT. Turn-on through R.g_on alone; turn-off through R.g_on in parallel with R.g_off + V.F. Driver values: STGAP3SXS datasheet DS14758</p>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">Rev 3, Table 5 (T.J = 25 C, VH = 15 V unless noted); the maximum figures are used for losses. Yellow cells are the inputs.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="185" width="1560" height="27" color="#0f2a44" fontSize="12" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 12px;">1  Switch and gate network</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="220" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Turn-ON gate resistor R.g_on (EVL board R15):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="220" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.g_on</e>
        <e type="operand">22</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">ohm</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="263" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Turn-OFF gate resistor R.g_off (EVL board R18):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="263" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.g_off</e>
        <e type="operand">2.2</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">ohm</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="306" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[TBD DS] D.off forward voltage at the peak current:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="306" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">V.F</e>
        <e type="operand">0.5</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">V</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="349" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">EVL board D1 is STPS2L40ZFY (Schottky); its datasheet was not available - read V.F at the D.off peak current of section 3.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="380" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[TBD DS] D.off surge current rating (0 = not entered):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="380" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">I.FSM_D</e>
        <e type="operand">0</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">A</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="423" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[TBD DS] D.off average forward current rating:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="423" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">I.F_D</e>
        <e type="operand">2</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">A</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="466" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">2 A is what the part name STPS2L40 implies - confirm from its datasheet.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="497" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Switch internal gate resistance (datasheet R.G):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="497" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.g_int</e>
        <e type="operand">0</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">ohm</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="540" width="470" height="47" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Switch total gate charge Q.g at V.H [10^-9 A s]:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="540" width="1080" height="47" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">Q.g</e>
        <e type="operand">210</e>
        <e type="operand">10</e>
        <e type="operand">9</e>
        <e type="operator" args="1">-</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">^</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">A</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">s</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="595" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">example value of the first version (WG75N65MFW1); use the gate charge curve of the switch at the drive voltage V.H.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="626" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Switches driven per channel (paralleled):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="626" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">n.par</e>
        <e type="operand">1</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="669" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Switching frequency:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="669" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">f.sw</e>
        <e type="operand">85</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">kHz</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="712" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Turn-ON gate voltage V.H (VH vs GNDISO):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="712" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">V.H</e>
        <e type="operand">18</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">V</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="755" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Turn-OFF gate voltage V.L (VL tied to GNDISO, unipolar):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="755" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">V.L</e>
        <e type="operand">0</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">V</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="798" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">DS 6.x: for unipolar drive connect GNDISO and VL with short traces.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="829" width="470" height="47" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Miller-clamp FET gate charge at V.CLAMP [10^-9 A s]:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="829" width="1080" height="47" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">Q.g_clamp</e>
        <e type="operand">0</e>
        <e type="operand">10</e>
        <e type="operand">9</e>
        <e type="operator" args="1">-</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">^</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">A</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">s</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="884" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">EVL board uses STL7N6F7 on CLAMPdrv; 0 = clamp not fitted. Its gate is charged to V.CLAMPdrv_H once per cycle.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="931" width="1560" height="27" color="#0f2a44" fontSize="12" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-size: 12px;">2  STGAP3SXS (DS14758 Rev 3)</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="966" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[DS] Source R.DS_ON, max (IGON 100 mA):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="966" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.on_H</e>
        <e type="operand">0.80</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">ohm</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1009" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">typ 0.65, min 0.50 ohm.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1184" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[DS] Sink R.DS_ON, max (IGOFF 100 mA):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1184" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">R.on_L</e>
        <e type="operand">0.65</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">ohm</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1227" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">typ 0.50, min 0.35 ohm.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1258" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[DS] Source short-circuit current, min over -40..125 C:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1258" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">I.src_max</e>
        <e type="operand">7</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">A</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1301" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">8 / 10 / 11.5 A min / typ / max at 25 C; 7 A is the characterization minimum.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1332" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[DS] Sink short-circuit current, min over -40..125 C:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1332" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">I.snk_max</e>
        <e type="operand">7</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">A</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1375" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[DS] VH quiescent current, max (IN+ = GND):</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1375" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">I.QH</e>
        <e type="operand">6</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">mA</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1418" width="1560" height="23" color="#444444" fontSize="9" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 9px;">typ 5 mA. The datasheet gives it only with the output low.</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1449" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">Logic supply VDD:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1449" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">V.DD</e>
        <e type="operand">5</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">V</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
    </math>
    </region>
    <region left="20" top="1492" width="470" height="35" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
    <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
      <content>
        <p style="font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-size: 10px;">[DS] VDD quiescent current, IN+ low, max:</p>
      </content>
    </text>
    </region>
    <region left="510" top="1492" width="1080" height="35" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="8" isBreakable="false">
    <math>
      <input>
        <e type="operand">I.DD_lo</e>
        <e type="operand">2.5</e>
        <e type="operand" style="unit">mA</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
      </input>
